flowchart TB
  B[Browser opens index.html] --> S[Shell navigation: scripts/index.js]
  S --> F[Feature page inside an iframe]
  F --> H[Page HTML: controls, forms and tables]
  H --> C[Shared and page-specific CSS]
  H --> P[Page JavaScript: events and rendering]
  P --> D[Pure calculations: domain and helper modules]
  P --> M[Shared models.js store and model methods]
  M --> DB[(Cloud Firestore documents)]
  R[firestore.rules: server-side permission policy] -. gates reads and writes .-> DB
  T[Node tests: pure rules, UI contracts and mocks] -. checks .-> D
  T -. checks .-> P
  E[Separate local emulator security test] -. checks rule behavior .-> R
